      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Disagree. Avatar scale affects the experience of other users and those people matter too. World creators need to have the tools to regulate that experience, because they're in the best position with the best information to make those judgements.\n\nIf there's any way you think it's likely that world authors would be abusive or neglectful with those tools, then please voice that specific concern, and this can be a discussion about how to solve those problems.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
