      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Restricting tall avatars is an obvious need. It seems a lot less likely to me that world authors would restrict small avatars unless it's necessary to the experience.\n\nIf world authors are setting people's heights needlessly then there should be a clear avenue for reporting and feedback to check the world author. That's the kind of solution there should be to this problem, not removing the tool entirely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
